10:05:49  ==============================================================================
10:05:49    presence training weights: min 0.17, median 0.24, max 15.27  (equal weight per class and per recording site)
10:05:49    species training weights: min 0.06, median 0.16, max 11.33  (equal weight per class and per recording site)
