10:05:50    logmel_db    InputLayer             output (None, 64, 63)         params       0
10:05:50    whiten       SpectralWhitening      output (None, 64, 63)         params       0
10:05:50    reshape      Reshape                output (None, 64, 63, 1)      params       0
10:05:50    band_norm    Rescaling              output (None, 64, 63, 1)      params       0
10:05:50    to_resnet_size Resizing               output (None, 128, 128, 1)    params       0
10:05:50    to_rgb       Conv2D                 output (None, 128, 128, 3)    params       6
10:05:50    resnet       Functional             output (None, 4, 4, 2048)     params 23,564,800
10:05:50    gap          GlobalAveragePooling2D output (None, 2048)           params       0
10:05:50    dropout      Dropout                output (None, 2048)           params       0
10:05:50    presence     Dense                  output (None, 1)              params   2,049
10:05:50    species      Dense                  output (None, 5)              params  10,245
10:05:50    total parameters: 23,577,100 (~23025 KB after int8 quantisation, ~92098 KB as float32 -- both small for an Android phone)
